    "rulingScope": "Three complete twinpacts and six official full print images/basic data, restrictions and exact-name full reprint search verified. Shinren creature sympathy counts only own current creatures with floor1 and keeps required civilization, paid both optional Light NEO and no-evolution paths; actual Light Shinkalize seed is a legal current-wording NEO base but not a creature for sympathy. W2/6000 and normal sickness versus evolution immediate attack. Justice Shaper public top3 all Light cards including Light spell-only twinpact face, mandatory all recovery, no extra fourth card, nonLight remainder grave, short deck exhaustion and actual QQQX public reveal permission. Jeira7500/W2 and creature sympathy; g1557 existing grant extended only with optional types whitelist, all old providers unaffected. Actual shield break grants by each creature/spell face printed cost<=3, excludes seed/gear/castle, source ignored/sealed/departed/enemy, both zero-mana creature and spell triggers; Mixel cheap front never grants its expensive spell half. Native double break captures and declares both Apocalypse Day and granted creature before resolution: after Apocalypse destroys Jeira, declared low-cost creature still summons. Flame Jail paid6 and genuine spell S-trigger/current7000 threshold excludes own/7500. Mclargen11000 blocker/W2 and opposing-creature choice protection, self Glory Muscle choice allowed, actual opposing Demon Hand/Aqua Surfer excluded, actual nonchoosing Apocalypse still destroys, ignored protection restores targeting. PSY Draw1 then exact own hand1 new facedown shield then exactly one physical own shield-zone card grave; new/old card, root/inner stack, actual attached crest and faceup G-castle, no fabricated shield when draw loses. Own hand choice privacy and opponent projection tested. Both seats, hidden-information/read-only AI, mana orientation, encrypted duel service. Focused112 plus distinct two captured-trigger and four face/seed extra cases passed, related213 and online5 passed. npm check/audit/old-data invariants passed; no full test or previous long group rerun; all previous pending preserved.",
